{"ROBBERY_SHUT_UP","reg=gang",{"Ay! Quiet! You screaming like somebody's coming!"}},
{"ROBBERY_SHUT_UP","reg=gang|world=road",{"Shut up, {g:man|lady}, the whole street don't need your business"}},
