{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=raider|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Hey, you! Stop right there, don't make us run you down!","Look what the ditch coughed up, stay put, sweetheart!","Boys, we got one! You there, freeze!","Yeah, you with the backpack! Stand still!","Payday, fellas! You, stop walking or start bleeding!","Whoa- where do you think you're going? Hold it right there!","Toll booth's open in {town} today - stop!","Circle up! You, not another step!"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=raider|tmp=predator,seasoned|world=road",{"Hold it right there, road meat! Don't you move a toe!"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=gang|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Yo! You! Hold up, we need to talk!","Aye, stop right there, this is our block now","Ayo, freeze! You walking through our turf without paying?","Hold up, hold up - where you think you going, homie?","That's the one right there - stop, don't be stupid!","Stand still, {g:man|lady}, you in the wrong neighborhood","Posted up all day waiting on somebody like you - stop!","Hey, hey, hey! Don't walk off, we see you!"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=club|hour=17,22",{"Evening, friend - stop right there and let's keep this friendly"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=club|tmp=predator,seasoned,veteran",{"Pull over, {g:pal|lady}, figure of speech - stand still","Easy now, stop walking - my brothers get twitchy when folks walk","Well, look at this - a pedestrian, right there's far enough, {g:pal|lady}"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=club|tmp=predator,seasoned,veteran|world=road",{"Hold up there, citizen, you're on our road"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=club|role=biker_boss",{"Nobody's gotta get hurt - stop where you are and listen to me","{g:Fella|Lady}, that's close enough - stand there and breathe for me"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=club|tmp=predator",{"Hey, boots! Stop! Prez wants a word!","Ride's over, {g:buddy|lady}, plant your feet!","Whoa there, pilgrim - where's the fire?"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=crime|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"Excuse me - stop right there, we have business","Hold on, friend, this takes one minute if you stand still","Stop, nobody needs to be a hero today","Right there, don't move, and this stays simple","You - stop - we're collecting","Stand still, please, I hate chasing people in this heat","Hold up, something in that bag belongs to us now, you just don't know it yet"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=prison|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Hey! HEY! Stop! Stop right there, I swear to God!","FREEZE! Right there, don't you twitch!","Oh, look who's walking around free - stop right there!","You! Freeze! You a guard? You look like a guard!","Stop right there! First live one I seen all week!","Hold it! Hold it! You yell and you're done!","Stand still! Eight years I waited to say that to somebody!"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"Stop, I'm too tired to chase you and too mean to let you go","Hold up, don't make this a long day","Right there, {g:bud|lady} - quit walking","Stop, we're all hungry, and you look like you ate","Hold it, stranger, you and me got something to settle","Stop right there, I don't want to shoot anybody before supper"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=raider,gang,club,crime,prison,outlaw|tmp=predator",{"Stop right there! Don't make me put one in you!"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=raider,gang,club,crime,prison,outlaw|tmp=seasoned",{"Hold it, you know how this goes by now"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","tmp=fresh",{"S-stop! Right there! Don't make me, I'm not kidding!","Hey you, stop! Please just stop, okay?","Don't move! I, uh, we're robbing you - sorry - don't move!","Stop! We don't want trouble, we just need your stuff!","Hold it! Stay right there! I've never done this, so don't test me!","Stop - I'm sorry, we have to - I'm sorry - just stop","Hold up! Hey! We won't hurt you if you stand still!"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=crime,outlaw|tmp=seasoned,veteran",{"Stop there, give us two minutes and we're gone"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=outlaw,crime,club",{"Hey - HEY! Don't run, it only makes it longer for the both of us","Stop, hands where I see 'em and we're done before it cools off"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=crime,club",{"Right there - put your feet together and listen to me"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=crime,outlaw",{"Stop walking, you'll be back walking inside a minute","Stop, I'm gonna talk, you're gonna nod, then you leave"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=crime|tmp=seasoned,veteran",{"Hold up, nothing here is personal and nothing here is negotiable"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=gang,crime,club",{"You - yeah, plant it right there on the white line"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=club,crime",{"Halt right there, friend, this is the short version of a bad day"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=raider,crime,gang|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"Stand still, done this a hundred times, you'll live"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=raider,outlaw,crime",{"Hold it. Look at me and listen"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=crime,outlaw|tmp=veteran",{"That's far enough, you walked into something - stand there and it stays small"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=raider,prison|tmp=predator",{"STOP! You hear me? Don't make this a chase in this heat!"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=gang",{"Aye, hold up! You and me gonna have a quick conversation"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=prison",{"STOP! Don't- Jesus, don't run, I hate running!"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned",{"Hold it, I've done this a hundred times and ain't lost one yet"}},
{"ROBBERY_SPOT","reg=elite",{"Stop. Stay exactly where you are","Don't run, you won't make it. Stand still","You there. Stop moving","That's far enough. We want what you carry, not you","Freeze. Whatever you're thinking, don't"}},
{"ROBBERY_TAKE","reg=raider|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"This is ours now - say thank you","Mine - that's mine - tell yourself you never wanted it","Look at this! Oh, this is coming home with us!","Oh, I like this. You gonna ask for it back?","We'll take that, and don't cry, it's embarrassing","Finders keepers, meat, we found you","Comes with me - good dog"}},
