{"ROBBERY_TAKE","reg=gang|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"This ours now - don't even look at it","I'll hold onto this - forever","Yeah, this coming with me","That's the toll for walking our block","Nice - real nice - ours now","You weren't keeping this anyway","That's the fee for crossing us"}},
{"ROBBERY_TAKE","reg=gang|tmp=predator,seasoned|world=road",{"Street tax, paid in full"}},
{"ROBBERY_TAKE","reg=club|tmp=predator,seasoned,veteran",{"This belongs to the club now","This rides with us, thanks for the donation","We'll put this to better use than you would've","Club dues, you're an honorary member for about thirty seconds"}},
{"ROBBERY_TAKE","reg=club|tmp=predator,seasoned,veteran|world=road",{"Consider it a road tax, friend"}},
