{"ROBBERY_TAKE","reg=club|tmp=predator",{"Ooh, nice, mine now, hoss!","That's sweet, better off with us"}},
{"ROBBERY_TAKE","reg=crime|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"Ours now, thanks for the donation!","We'll take this, consider your debt settled","Good, that covers it","This goes on our side of the ledger","We're taking this - don't take it personally, it's inventory","This is worth more to us than to a dead man - you're welcome","Payment received"}},
{"ROBBERY_TAKE","reg=prison|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"MINE! This is mine now!","Oh yeah, oh yeah - Christmas on the yard!","This is ours! You'll get over it!","Ha! This is mine, sucker!","Taking this - you got a problem? Keep it to yourself!","Look at this! Look what we got!","State took everything I had once, now I'm the state"}},
{"ROBBERY_TAKE","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"This'll do, we're taking it","Ours now - don't take it to heart","I'll need this more than you, I reckon","That'll do - thanks","Taking this - sorry, no, I ain't","Somebody's always taking from somebody, that's just how it goes now"}},
