{"ROBBERY_TAKE","tmp=fresh",{"I'm taking this - I'm sorry - we need it, okay?","We, we need this, I can't go back without it","This is ours now, oh God, I can't believe I said that","I'll take this, you'd do the same if you were desperate","I'm taking this, I need-- I'm taking it - I'm sorry","This is coming with me, and then... then we're done"}},
{"ROBBERY_TAKE","reg=crime,outlaw",{"This much, and don't argue - see? Fair","I'll take this - not an argument, just telling you how it is","This ain't personal - Thursday it might be, today it ain't"}},
