{"ROBBERY_TAKE","reg=crime|tmp=veteran",{"We'll take what we can use, you don't get a vote - everybody wins"}},
{"ROBBERY_TAKE","reg=crime",{"Taken, done, no speeches, let's not drag it out","That's ours now, get moving before we take anything else"}},
