{"ROBBERY_TAKE","reg=club",{"This rides out with us, don't get stupid over it"}},
{"ROBBERY_TAKE","reg=gang",{"Yeah, this mine - don't look at it like that","Taking this, next time bring more and we'll be quicker"}},
{"ROBBERY_TAKE","reg=prison|tmp=predator",{"MINE! Eight years... eight damn years and I finally got something!","My take stays with me, all of it - don't say nothing"}},
