{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=raider|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"PUT THE WEAPON DOWN! DROP IT OR DIE HOLDING IT!","Drop that thing, meat! DROP IT!","You gonna fight all of us with that? PUT IT DOWN!","WEAPON ON THE GROUND! Kick it away, slow!","Oh, look, a toy! PUT IT DOWN before I shove it somewhere!","Open that hand and let it fall! NOW!","You try that and you're dead before it lands! DROP IT!","LET GO OF IT! I'll wear your teeth on a string!"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=gang|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"DROP IT! Drop the damn weapon!","Put that down, {g:man|lady}! You ain't gonna use it!","You really gonna try us? PUT IT DOWN!","Weapon on the ground! On the ground right now!","Let it go, homie! Let it GO!","You holding? Put it DOWN before I put YOU down!","Drop it and step off it! Step OFF it!","Ain't nobody scared of that! PUT IT DOWN!"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=club|tmp=predator,seasoned,veteran",{"Set it down, friend - gently, nobody here wants a war","You're holding something you'll regret, lay it on the ground","Lay it down on the blacktop and back up two steps","Hand off the grip - let it hit the ground"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=club|tmp=predator",{"PUT IT DOWN! Now, hoss!","DROP IT, or I'll wrap it around your neck!"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=club|role=biker_boss",{"Put the weapon down, you try it, and every one of my brothers comes for you","Look around you, {g:pal|lady}, count us, then put it down"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=crime|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"Put the weapon down, it's not worth what it'll cost you","Drop it, please, I'd hate for this to turn expensive","Weapon down - now, we both know how it ends otherwise","PUT IT DOWN! This isn't a negotiation!","Let go of it, holding on is a bad investment","Lay it down and slide it over with your foot","Weapon on the ground, friend, nobody's billing you for the scare"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=prison|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"DROP IT! DROP IT DROP IT DROP IT!","PUT IT DOWN! You pull that on me, you'll regret it, I swear!","Drop it! I seen men die for holding a shank too long!","You wanna play hard?! PUT IT DOWN!","Weapon DOWN! I'm crazy, {g:man|lady}, I got papers that say so!","Throw it! Throw it away from you! FAR!","Put it down or I'll take it off you and use it on you!"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"Put it down, you won't get a second try","Drop the weapon, I'm too tired for a fight and so are you","PUT IT DOWN! Ain't worth dying over your stuff!","Set that down in the dirt, stranger - slow","Let it drop, don't make me come there and take it","Weapon down, and I'll pretend I never saw it"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=raider,gang,club,crime,prison,outlaw|tmp=predator",{"PUT THE WEAPON DOWN! You don't want to find out!"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=raider,gang,club,crime,prison,outlaw|tmp=seasoned",{"Weapon down, I've watched that play end a dozen ways, none good for you"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","tmp=fresh",{"PUT IT DOWN! Please put it down!","Drop the weapon! I mean it! I'm not bluffing!","Put that down! I don't want anybody to die today!","Please, PLEASE put the weapon down! My hands are shaking!","Put it down! Please! I don't want to find out if I can hurt you!","Drop it! Drop it! Oh God, I said drop it!"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=crime,outlaw",{"Put the weapon down and nobody has to be brave today","Weapon down, let's not turn a two minute stop into a burial"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=crime|tmp=seasoned,veteran",{"Weapon on the ground, two minutes and maybe you pick it back up"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=crime,club",{"Let it go, holding on is a bad bet"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=crime,gang,outlaw",{"Down - let it drop and step back off it - both feet"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=crime,club,raider",{"Put it down, look around you, ain't hard to figure"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=outlaw,crime",{"Hand off it - don't be the man who tried, not in this heat"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=outlaw,crime,club|tmp=seasoned,veteran",{"Set it down easy, a fight out here brings worse than us"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"DROP IT! You'll drop it either way, this is the version you live through!"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=raider|tmp=predator",{"Put it DOWN! I'll feed it to you sideways!","Ooh, {he}'s feeling brave! Put it down, precious!"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=gang",{"Drop that, drop it - I ain't gonna say drop it again","You holding trouble in the wrong place, {g:man|lady}, set it down"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=club",{"Lay that down, friend, there's more of us than there is of that"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=prison",{"Put it down! I know what somebody looks like before they try it, and that's you!"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=prison|tmp=predator",{"DROP IT! You ain't a killer, I can smell it on you!"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned,veteran",{"Put it down, men who meant it have tried me - you don't"}},
{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=crime",{"Lay the weapon down, there's no insurance anymore, so don't test it"}},
