{"ROBBERY_WEAPON_DOWN","reg=elite",{"Drop the weapon. Do it slowly","Put it on the ground and step away from it","That goes down now, or you go down after it","Take your hand off it. Set it down, then back away","You can't win this one. Put it down"}},
